		<description><![CDATA[Maryam was my friend of almost 30 years, and my mureed.  She was a beautiful soul whose life was spent in service to others, through her profession of nursing.  All who met her were touched by her beauty, her loving and wise care. She was born and grew up in England, lived and worked in Saudi Arabia, then came to the mountains and deserts of Arizona, where she lived out her life.   I miss her!  and so do many others.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Maryam was my friend of almost 30 years, and my mureed.  She was a beautiful soul whose life was spent in service to others, through her profession of nursing.  All who met her were touched by her beauty, her loving and wise care. She was born and grew up in England, lived and worked in Saudi Arabia, then came to the mountains and deserts of Arizona, where she lived out her life.   I miss her!  and so do many others.</p>
